        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://yzzfo.github.io/unity/store/Text Animator for Unity/ignore-index-en/"/>
        <id>https://yzzfo.github.io/unity/store/Text Animator for Unity/ignore-index-en/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://yzzfo.github.io/unity/store/Text Animator for Unity/ignore-index-en/">&lt;p&gt;Chosen by wonderful games like Dredge, Cult of The Lamb, Slime Rancher 2 and many more, Text Animator for Unity is a powerful and flexible tool that brings your texts to life in very few simple steps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;p &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Winner of Unity&#x27;s Best Artistic Tool Award in 2023&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;, Text Animator for Unity lets you animate letters and stack effects together (from built-in to your custom ones), show text dynamically with different speeds (like characters, puntuactions and words), trigger gameplay events when a specific letter is shown and much more! Works in any platform and rendering pipeline.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;&lt;&#x2F;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;docs.febucci.com&#x2F;text-animator-unity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📝 Documentation&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;: learn everthing about the asset and &lt;strong&gt; feel comfortable &lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;even before downloading it.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.febucci.com&#x2F;text-animator-unity&#x2F;showcase&#x2F;&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;🎮 Games&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;: discover the many games that are using Text Animator and submit your(s) for future showcases.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;docs.febucci.com&#x2F;text-animator-unity&#x2F;other&#x2F;requirements-and-limitations&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👍🏻 Requirements&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;: read its &lt;strong&gt; requirements &lt;&#x2F;strong&gt; and learn exactly what you can do.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;&lt;li &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.febucci.com&#x2F;text-animator-unity&#x2F;support&#x2F;&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📧 Support&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;: for any question or support request.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;&lt;&#x2F;br&gt;&lt;p &gt;&lt;em&gt;Have fun bringing your texts to life!&lt;&#x2F;em&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
</content>
        
